-- TCMS baseline schema (17 tables) — generated by
-- `npx prisma migrate dev --create-only --name init_mysql` (Prisma 6.19.2)
-- against an EMPTY disposable schema, then HAND-EDITED (task mysql-baseline-1):
--   1. utf8mb4_bin on the two SECRET columns (users.password_hash,
--      refresh_tokens.token) — case-SENSITIVE compare (docs/migration/02).
--   2. Expression defaults on all 7 JSON array columns
--      (DEFAULT (CAST('[]' AS JSON))) — raw-SQL INSERTs that omit them must
--      still work (the old scripts/migration/mysql-json-defaults.sql, now
--      replaced by this migration).
-- Single collation everywhere else: utf8mb4_unicode_ci (owner decision,
-- matches Prisma's output; the utf8mb4/utf8mb4_0900_ai_ci SERVER default is
-- irrelevant because every table pins its own charset+collation).
-- IMPORTANT: hand-edits here are the schema source of truth — `prisma
-- migrate diff` cannot model collations or JSON expression defaults. A
-- drift_check migration must stay EMPTY (see scripts/mysql-baseline-test.mjs).

